UID:120383-1778175000-1778180400@www.naturalsciences.org
SUMMARY:Air it Out: Use Your Voice (Whiteville)
DESCRIPTION:“Air it Our: Use Your Voice” is an educational empowerment‑focused program that connects young people with real‑world advocacy through the lens of air‑quality awareness. The presentation explores air quality issues in North Carolina\, highlights how youth can raise awareness in their schools and neighborhoods\, and demonstrates how advocacy can shape future career paths. \n\n\nFood will be provided. \n\n\nAbout the Speaker: \n\n\nThe session is led by Deborah Effon\, a member of the NC Air Awareness Team\, who works across the state teaching students about air quality and its impact on public health. Her passion for advocacy\, public health\, and communication has guided her journey into a meaningful career in state government. Through her story\, students see how following their interests and using their voices can open doors to opportunities and inspire long‑term change.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/air-it-out-use-your-voice-whiteville/
LOCATION:Whiteville\, 415 South Madison Street\, Whiteville\, NC\, 28472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Teen Science Cafes,Teens
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Deborah-Effon-Headshot-Photo.jpg
GEO:34.3258479;-78.7027078
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Whiteville 415 South Madison Street Whiteville NC 28472 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=415 South Madison Street:geo:-78.7027078,34.3258479
END:VEVENT
