SUMMARY:Science Trivia feat. State Archives & Library of NC
DESCRIPTION:What’s cooler than absolute zero? The answer is trivia night at NCMNS\, and this month we’re bringing a special treat.\nTrivia masters from the North Carolina Museum of Natural Sciences\, the Library of NC Government & Heritage Library\, and the State Archives of North Carolina will join forces for the ultimate night of North Carolina science\, science history\, geography and culture. Let’s hope you’ve been using that library card! \nGather in the Daily Planet Cafe with your team or play solo to compete for prizes\, bragging rights\, and perhaps even learn something cool. \nThe Museum closes at 5 PM; the Daily Planet Cafe will remain open.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/science-trivia-feat-library-of-nc-state-archives/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Daily Planet Cafe,General Events,Science Cafes,Teens,Trivia
ORGANIZER;CN="Chris%20Smith":MAILTO:christopher.smith@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.7822735;-78.6395502
